    "name": "DADOO: Twists, Turns, and Mischiefs",
    "steam_appid": 2230290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/5807b9b437568f35894fd4d4fcf62168.avif?t=1736824332\" /></div><br><br><strong>DADOO: Twists, Turns, and Mischiefs is a Snake and Ladder Game, with superpowers!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/943c1faaf6790a189f7815e9e08389cc.poster.avif?t=1736824332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/943c1faaf6790a189f7815e9e08389cc.webm?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/943c1faaf6790a189f7815e9e08389cc.mp4?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Welcome to the mad, chaotic, and thrilling world of DADOO - a reinvention of the classic Snake and Ladder game that you thought you knew so well! <br><br>This is no ordinary multiplayer game. It's a ruthless battlefield where your strategic thinking will be tested. Do not rely on luck, and the only thing that you can trust is yourself. But remember, there's more to this game than simply reaching the top. Enjoy the ride, let the chaos unfold, and don't forget to make the others feel miserable.<br><br>So, what are you waiting for? Roll the dice, play your cards, and invite your friend into the pandemonium of chaos. Just make sure you're still friends after playing <strong>DADOO: Twists, Turns, and Mischiefs</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/35c8173428f9e268468c26e71157061e.avif?t=1736824332\" /></div><br><br><strong>1. There are Snakes.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/bd3e4849f4f1b9a14e4031e4a0b14769.poster.avif?t=1736824332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/bd3e4849f4f1b9a14e4031e4a0b14769.webm?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/bd3e4849f4f1b9a14e4031e4a0b14769.mp4?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>2. There are ladders (They are cannons in this gif, tho). </strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/b71dcacfad4205a1c9c38ede4c7d8b69.poster.avif?t=1736824332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/b71dcacfad4205a1c9c38ede4c7d8b69.webm?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/b71dcacfad4205a1c9c38ede4c7d8b69.mp4?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>3. More than 20 superpower cards that you can use to attack your enemy (Or defend too!)</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/51f99587c10cfa2f4fc9dfb7e61443d3.poster.avif?t=1736824332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/51f99587c10cfa2f4fc9dfb7e61443d3.webm?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/51f99587c10cfa2f4fc9dfb7e61443d3.mp4?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>4. Cross-platform multiplayer game! Play the game together with your friend on the PC and Android smartphones.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/a3f7c0f4c273bd3ec5a8795050ad342c.poster.avif?t=1736824332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/a3f7c0f4c273bd3ec5a8795050ad342c.webm?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/a3f7c0f4c273bd3ec5a8795050ad342c.mp4?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>5. Multiple languages support, including English, Indonesian, Portuguese, Korean, and Japanese.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/ab997f2bd8869be4a999a348c4a453d0.poster.avif?t=1736824332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/ab997f2bd8869be4a999a348c4a453d0.webm?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/ab997f2bd8869be4a999a348c4a453d0.mp4?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>6. Various cute mascot characters to choose from.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/8ea3e5ad5235806144aa901c1729dbd1.poster.avif?t=1736824332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/8ea3e5ad5235806144aa901c1729dbd1.webm?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/8ea3e5ad5235806144aa901c1729dbd1.mp4?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>7. Oh, each character has their own unique superpower too.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/2184721b659da4044258c7fe8c3f139b.poster.avif?t=1736824332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/2184721b659da4044258c7fe8c3f139b.webm?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230290/extras/2184721b659da4044258c7fe8c3f139b.mp4?t=1736824332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Buy the Steam version of Dadoo and get an exclusive bundle! Unlock a new card and skin with this unique offer.</strong>",
